-    *   Initialize the logit pre-activation value [S3, S5, unofficial].
-    *   **Standard:** Set to 8.0, which yields $\sigma(8.0) \approx 0.9997$ [S3, unofficial].
-    *   **Alternative:** Set to the logit of 0.1, i.e., $\log(0.1 / 0.9)$ [S1, unofficial].
-    *   **Clamping:** Clamp the initial opacity value (e.g., 0.5) to the range $[10^{-4}, 0.99]$, then apply the logit function to create the learnable parameter [S5, unofficial].
