-    *   Compute the 3D covariance matrix:
-        $$
-        \Sigma = R S S^T R^T
-        $$
-    *   **2D Projection:** For rendering, transform to camera space [S5, unofficial]. Let $W$ be the world-to-camera rotation matrix and $J$ be the Jacobian of the perspective projection:
-        $$
-        J = \begin{bmatrix}
-        f/z & 0 & -f x/z^2 \\
-        0 & f/z & -f y/z^2
-        \end{bmatrix}
-        $$
